## Overview
<1-2 paragraph summary>

## Key Patterns
- Pattern 1: <description> + code snippet
- Pattern 2: ...

## API Reference
<Signatures with brief descriptions>

## Gotchas
- <Common mistake and how to avoid it>

## Cross-References
- [[RelatedPage1]] — <why it's related>
- [[RelatedPage2]] — <why it's related>

---
### Jinn Heuristics
- HEURISTIC: <rule> — <source: {{ category }}>
```

